---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { productUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
import '../styles/editorial.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="How we help" description="Hyphos Inc. connects business systems, builds custom software and makes organizational knowledge usable. Start with the work that's getting stuck.">
<section class="editorial-hero page-shell"><p class="section-label">Consulting & implementation</p><h1>Build around<br />the way you work.</h1><p>Start with a real constraint. Connect what's useful. Build what's missing. Make the result something your team can run.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--ink">Talk through a problem ↗</a></section>
<section class="editorial-services page-shell"><article id="build"><span class="section-label">01 / Connect existing systems</span><div><h2>Close the gaps people<br />are bridging by hand.</h2><p>Accounting, customer information, scheduling, websites and documents. When the systems share information, your team spends less time retyping, checking and chasing.</p><p>We map the workflow, identify the handoffs that create the most friction, and build the connections around them.</p><a href="/work/cornerstone" class="text-link">See the connected software ↗</a></div></article><article id="custom"><span class="section-label">02 / Custom software</span><div><h2>When the tool doesn't fit,<br />change the tool.</h2><p>Internal applications, customer portals, mobile products and business platforms. Software shaped around your terminology, your processes and the exceptions that matter.</p><p>We show working increments early, so the people who know the work can shape the result.</p><a href="/work#wander" class="text-link">See how we built Wander ↗</a></div></article><article id="knowledge"><span class="section-label">03 / Knowledge & practical AI</span><div><h2>Put the right information<br />within reach.</h2><p>Useful AI starts with the business context behind the question. We look at the information, the sources and the decisions a workflow depends on.</p><p>For teams exploring knowledge retention and better handoffs, this is also the focus of the Hyphos product.</p><a href={productUrl} class="text-link">Explore Hyphos ↗</a></div></article></section>
<section class="editorial-closing page-shell"><span class="section-label">The first conversation</span><h2>Bring one thing<br />that takes too much effort.</h2><p>Tell us what happens today, which systems are involved and who has to hold it together. We'll start from there.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--ink">Talk with us ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
